  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *opinado*",
    "*opinar sobre/de algo* = to have an opinion about something (*¿Qué opinas de esto?* — What do you think about this?)",
    "*opinar que* + indicative = to think that (*Opino que tiene razón* — I think he's right)",
    "Related: *la opinión* = opinion; *en mi opinión* = in my opinion",
    "Similar to *pensar* (to think) but *opinar* specifically means to give/hold an opinion"
  ],
